# ESP-Hosted SDIO configuration for the Elecrow CrowPanel ESP32-P4 Advance
# 10.1" (SKU DHE04310D, hardware/software V1.1). jc1060's board variant
# (esp32-p4-evboard) apparently defaults to different SDIO pins/bus width
# than this board actually uses -- these lines override just the ESP_HOSTED
# SDIO settings for the [env:crowpanel] build (see platformio.ini), leaving
# everything else (PSRAM, flash, partitions, BT) to the board variant's own
# defaults, same as jc1060 gets today.
#
# UNCONFIRMED whether this file actually gets merged into the build under
# framework=arduino -- see platformio.ini's board_build.cmake_extra_args
# comment. The values below are NOT what's actually used at runtime today;
# see src/data/fetcher.cpp's hostedSetPins() call, which is what real
# hardware testing confirmed necessary and is authoritative. Kept here for
# whatever this file is worth (e.g. a future framework=espidf move).
#
# 1ST ATTEMPT (WRONG): values copied verbatim from Elecrow-RD/CrowPanel-
# Advanced-10.1inch-ESP32-P4-HMI-AI-Display-1024x600-IPS-Touch-Screen, path
# example/V1.1/idf-code/Lesson17-Wi-Fi_function/ESP32_P4-softAP/
# sdkconfig.defaults.esp32p4 (fetched 2026-07-25) -- 1-bit bus, D0=14/D1=15.
# Real hardware testing showed this doesn't work (same sdmmc_io "failed to
# read registers" timeout persisted).
#
# CURRENT BEST KNOWN (from GitHub issue #9 on that same repo -- someone hit
# this identical "H_SDIO_DRV fault" bringing up WiFi on MicroPython for this
# same V1.1/V1.2 hardware and reverse-engineered a working config): bus
# width is actually 4-bit, and D0-D3 are wired in REVERSE order from
# arduino-esp32's precompiled default. The Lesson17 example above is
# apparently stale or was for different/earlier hardware -- not trustworthy
# as a source for this board's SDIO pinout despite being labeled V1.1.
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_4_BIT_BUS=y
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_BUS_WIDTH=4
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_CLOCK_FREQ_KHZ=40000
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_PRIV_SDIO_PIN_CMD_SLOT_1=19
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_PRIV_SDIO_PIN_CLK_SLOT_1=18
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_PRIV_SDIO_PIN_D0_SLOT_1=17
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_PRIV_SDIO_PIN_D1_4BIT_BUS_SLOT_1=16
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_PRIV_SDIO_PIN_D2_4BIT_BUS_SLOT_1=15
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_PRIV_SDIO_PIN_D3_4BIT_BUS_SLOT_1=14
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_GPIO_RESET_SLAVE=32
CONFIG_ESP_HOSTED_SDIO_RESET_ACTIVE_HIGH=y
